OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AActress Selma Blair says she 'did not
OL,4,Aintend to harm anyone' in plane
OL,5,Aaltercation
OL,6,
OL,7,FBlair's publicist said that the
OL,8,F54-year-old had a neurological disorder
OL,9,Fthat "bears directly on how a medical
OL,10,Fepisode presents to people who do not
OL,11,Fknow her".
OL,13,FThe star pleaded not guilty to charges
OL,14,Fthat she assaulted an officer and a
OL,15,Fnurse after being removed from the
OL,16,Fflight. She was also accused of
OL,17,Fassulting two flight attendants on
OL,18,Fboard.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
